### Cancelaciónes ###

### LIMIT (NEW) para cancelar
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 45,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 5,
  "price": 900
}

### Orden LIMIT pendiente, usar el id anterior en la orden LIMIT
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/${ID_ANTERIOR}/cancel

### Orden no se puede cancelar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel

### Orden no existe
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/1212/cancel

### Id inválido
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/qwerty/cancel
